    "text": "9 hours ago CORAL SPRINGS, Fla. — A 37-year-old man wanted on an active warrant was arrested at a Broward County elementary school last week. Officers with the Coral Springs Police Department said they took Wesley Henrique Ferreira Ramos Pereira into custody on Thursday outside of Coral Park Elementary School, located at 8401 Westview Drive. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
